    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm performing. i wake up, i eat, i go to work, but there's no one actually behind the eyes. it’s like the person who actually lived my life went away with them, and this thing left behind is just a hollow shell. i look in the mirror and i don't recognize the person looking back. it's such a heavy, empty way to exist.",
